text:
Q: Get Visual Studio to run a T4 template on every build A: <p>This is so easy. There isn’t any need to install anything:</p>
<pre class="lang-xml prettyprint-override"><code>&lt;Target Name=&quot;TransformAllT4Templates&quot; BeforeTargets=&quot;BeforeBuild&quot;&gt;
    &lt;ItemGroup&gt;
      &lt;!-- This picks up all T4 templates in the project --&gt;
      &lt;T4Template Include=&quot;**\*.tt&quot; /&gt;
    &lt;/ItemGroup&gt;
    &lt;!-- Iterate over each .tt file and run TextTransform.exe --&gt;
    &lt;Exec Command=&quot;&amp;quot;$(DevEnvDir)TextTransform.exe&amp;quot; &amp;quot;%(T4Template.FullPath)&amp;quot;&quot; /&gt;
  &lt;/Target&gt;
</code></pre>
